# Nar Shaddaa, the landing pad, the docks and the Refugee Sector (TSL,
# 003EBO, 352NAR, 301NAR, 303NAR, 302NAR): Visas Marr's ambush aboard the
# Ebon Hawk, fought and spared, and her joining; the galaxy map to Nar Shaddaa,
# Atton's landing talk, Goto's yacht's scene (352NAR), ashore; Quello told
# his trash heap holds the Hawk up (no lie, no DSP); the first refugee
# saved from the Exchange thugs and told the Exile was glad to help (LSP),
# five credits for the second and Kreia's lesson considered (+INF), Rutum
# taken under the Exile's protection (the thugs fought), Kreia's touch of
# the true Nar Shaddaa, Geeda kept against Oondar (Oondar told to give the
# Exchange the Exile's description, the Exchange's notice +1; Geeda's trade
# routes: Dantooine's settled); the docks: Fassa's pylons (pylon 2
# powered, the freighters ordered Silver Zephyr, Alakandor, Toorna's
# Profits: the Exchange's notice +1) and Lootra's lost wife taken on; the
# Refugee Sector: the toll's thugs intimidated and fought (+1), Aaida sent
# to Lootra (LSP), the Serroco fought to their leader (+1). Ratrin's claim
# on the Ebon Hawk, met on the way, is granted (LSP).
# Starts from Dantooine's last checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @dantooine_done data/routes/tsl/nar_shaddaa_landing.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Nar Shaddaa Main Area", "Docks Area" and
# "Refugee Sector" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Left: the swoop droid, the Exchange deal, the droid IT-31, the pazaak
# den, Vogga's dance (Vogga's door is opened by it; his fuel and his help
# against Goto go with it), Geriel, Nadaa, Saquesh, the airspeeder.
